From: rolex bring-up <rolex@local>
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] wwan: rpmsg_wwan_ctrl: jangan ambil channel AT Qualcomm

Port WWAN adalah char device tanpa termios -> alat berbasis tty (sms_tool, gcom,
3ginfo-lite) gagal "tcsetattr: Bad file descriptor". Channel AT "DATA4"/"DATA1"
diserahkan ke rpmsg_tty (patch berikutnya) -> /dev/ttyRPMSGx.
Channel QMI ("DATA5_CNTL") tetap ditangani driver ini.

--- a/drivers/net/wwan/rpmsg_wwan_ctrl.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wwan/rpmsg_wwan_ctrl.c
@@ -148,8 +148,12 @@
 static const struct rpmsg_device_id rpmsg_wwan_ctrl_id_table[] = {
 	/* RPMSG channels for Qualcomm SoCs with integrated modem */
 	{ .name = "DATA5_CNTL", .driver_data = WWAN_PORT_QMI },
-	{ .name = "DATA4", .driver_data = WWAN_PORT_AT },
-	{ .name = "DATA1", .driver_data = WWAN_PORT_AT },
+	/*
+	 * Channel AT ("DATA4"/"DATA1") sengaja tidak diambil di sini: port WWAN
+	 * adalah char device tanpa termios, sehingga alat berbasis tty
+	 * (sms_tool, gcom, 3ginfo-lite) gagal "Bad file descriptor".
+	 * Channel AT ditangani rpmsg_tty -> /dev/ttyRPMSGx.
+	 */
 	{},
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(rpmsg, rpmsg_wwan_ctrl_id_table);
